{"text": "Nag slid into the bathroom and coiled himself around the big water jar. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> He planned to wait there until the big man came in the morning. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> After an hour, Rikki jumped and caught Nags head in his teeth. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Nag swung him around the room like a dog shaking a rat, but Rikki held on. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> The noise woke the big man, who ran in with his gun and fired. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> It is the mongoose again, Alice, he said, The little chap has saved our lives now. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> The next morning, Darzee sang happily about Nags death, but Rikki still had work to do. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Where are Nagainas eggs, asked Rikki, In the melon bed, said Darzee. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Darzees wife, who was smarter than her husband, flew to Nagaina and cried, Oh, my wing is broken. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> While Nagaina chased the bird, Rikki ran to the melon bed and found twenty five eggs. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> He broke the eggs one by one until only three were left. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Then Darzees wife screamed, Nagaina has gone onto the veranda, and she means killing.", "alignment": {"characters": ["N", "a", "g", " ", "s", "l", "i", "d", " ", "i", "n", "t", "o", " ", "t", "h", "e", " ", "b", "a", "t", "h", "r", "o", "o", "m", " ", "a", "n", "d", " ", "c", "o", "i", "l", "e", "d", " ", "h", "i", "m", "s", "e", "l", "f", " ", "a", "r", "o", "u", "n", "d", " ", "t", "h", "e", " ", "b", "i", "g", " ", "w", "a", "t", "e", "r", " ", "j", "a", "r", ".", " ", "<", "b", "r", "e", "a", "k", " ", "t", "i", "m", "e", "=", "\"", "0", ".", "8", "s", "\"", " ", "/", ">", " ", "H", "e", " ", "p", "l", "a", "n", "n", "e", "d", " ", "t", "o", " ", "w", "a", "i", "t", " ", "t", "h", "e", "r", "e", " ", "u", "n", "t", "i", "l", " ", "t", "h", "e", " ", "b", "i", "g", " ", "m", "a", "n", " ", "c", "a", "m", "e", " ", "i", "n", " ", "t", "h", "e", " ", "m", "o", "r", "n", "i", "n", "g", ".", " ",